    details = <
        ["de"] = <
            language = <[ISO_639-1::de]>
            purpose = <"Zur Darstellung der Befunde, die bei der körperlichen Untersuchung der Muskelkraft einer Muskelgruppe oder Gliedmaße beobachtet wurden.">
            use = <"Zur Darstellung der beobachteten Befunde bei der körperlichen Untersuchung der Muskelkraft einer Muskelgruppe oder Gliedmaße.

Dieses Archetyp wurde speziell dafür entwickelt, im SLOT „Examination detail“ innerhalb des OBSERVATION.exam- oder des CLUSTER.exam-nervous_system-Archetyps verwendet zu werden. Es kann auch innerhalb anderer relevanter OBSERVATION- oder körperlicher Untersuchungs-CLUSTER-Archetypen verschachtelt werden, sofern dies klinisch sinnvoll ist.

In klinischen Situationen, in denen mehr als eine Kraftreaktion dokumentiert werden muss, sollte für jede Muskelgruppe oder Gliedmaße eine separate Instanz dieses Archetyps verwendet werden.">
            misuse = <"">
        >
        ["en"] = <
            language = <[ISO_639-1::en]>
            purpose = <"To record the findings observed during the physical examination of power in a muscle group or a limb.">
            use = <"Use to record the observed findings during the physical examination of power in a muscle group or a limb.

This archetype has been specifically designed to be used in the 'Examination detail' SLOT within the OBSERVATION.exam or the CLUSTER.exam-nervous_system archetype. It can also be nested within any other relevant OBSERVATION or Physical examination-related family of CLUSTER archetypes, where clinically appropriate. 

In clinical scenarios requiring the documentation of more than one strength response, use a separate instance of this archetype for each muscle group or limb.">
            misuse = <"">
            copyright = <"© openEHR Foundation">
        >
    >

definition
    CLUSTER[at0000] matches {    -- Muscle power finding
        items cardinality matches {1..*; unordered} matches {
            ELEMENT[at0001] occurrences matches {1} matches {    -- Body site
                value matches {
                    DV_CODED_TEXT[at9002] matches {
                        defining_code matches {[ac9000]}    -- Body site (synthesised)
                    }
                    DV_TEXT[at9003]
                }
            }
            ELEMENT[at0006] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- Clinical description
                value matches {
                    DV_TEXT[at9004]
                }
            }
            ELEMENT[at0007] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- Strength
                value matches {
                    DV_TEXT[at9005]
                    DV_ORDINAL[at9006] matches {
                        [value, symbol] matches {
                            [{0}, {[at0008]}],    -- No visible muscle contraction
                            [{1}, {[at0009]}],    -- Visible muscle contraction with no or trace movement
                            [{2}, {[at0010]}],    -- Limb movement, but not against gravity
                            [{3}, {[at0011]}],    -- Movement against gravity but not resistance
                            [{4}, {[at0012]}],    -- Movement against at least some resistance supplied by the examiner
                            [{5}, {[at0013]}]    -- Full strength
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            ELEMENT[at0014] occurrences matches {0..1} matches {    -- Comment
                value matches {
                    DV_TEXT[at9007]
                }
            }
        }
    }

